===Preposition===
{{fr-prep}}

# [[against]] {{gloss|in physical contact with}}
#: ''La paille est contre la maison''
#:: ''the straw is against the house''
#: ''Elle s'appuie contre le mur.''
#:: ''She's pushing against the wall.''
# [[against]] {{gloss|not in favor of}}
#: ''Les citoyens sont pour, mais les hommes politiques sont '''contre'''.''
#:: ''The citizens are for, but the politicians are against.''
# [[against]] {{gloss|having as an opponent}}
#: ''Ce soir: Lille contre Marseille en direct.''
#:: ''Tonight: Lille against Marseille live.''
# [[as against]] {{gloss|[[as opposed to]], compared to, in contrast with}}
# [[in exchange]] for
#: {{ux|fr|10% des hommes ont eu plus de cent partenaires sexuels, contre 5% seulement des femmes.|10 percent of all men have had more than a hundred sexual partners, as against 5 percent of all women.}}

